# Escalation Extension Rule

Before modifying this repository:
1. Read `docs/PROJECT_MEMORY.md`.
2. Keep the floating escalation bar compact, categorized, and draggable.
3. Preserve the confirmation modal preview to prevent accidental escalations.
4. Maintain all 14 escalation codes, BIT88 User Notes / Zoom wording, KYC SWITCH DUP-ID Zoom fill, and a one-tab Settings list (rows stay one line; Edit popup for notes, Zoom, reasons). Add a button starts with Reason / User Notes / Zoom field checkboxes.
